  "description": "PEWXOI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C116 H128 Ce6 O34,C20 H30 Co1. From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 9 O neighbors; Ce1F (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce2F (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce3F (Ce) has 9 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.702-3.832 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.77-118.23°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Cp*2Co][Ce6O4(OH)4(O2CC8H9)12(thf)2] (C136H158Ce6CoO34). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
